{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["And the meaning of <b>as this day</b> is that so it shall be for all their seed forever. I have already explained the desire and the choice (Ramban on Deuteronomy 7:7). And the meaning of 'heavens of the heavens' is the spheres of the four elements, for they are within the potency of the heavens below them, in the manner of 'the earth and all that is upon it' (Nehemiah 9:6). And likewise he said in the psalm: 'Praise YHWH from the heavens, praise Him in the heights' (Psalms 148:1) — and he mentioned His angels and His hosts and the sun and the moon and the stars of light, and afterward [came] 'praise Him, heavens of the heavens' (Psalms 148:4)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:14:00.796580101Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}